# Tiny book of EMT simulation, chapter 8: the circuit of chapter 4 with a switch that opens at 3 ms.
# The book works through the plain trapezoidal rule (chapter 8 shows its chatter), so
# chatter removal and switching interpolation are off here.
.options chatter=off interp=off
.tran 0.0001 0.005
V 0 1  10 0 0      # BATTERY
SW 1 2  closed 0.003  # SWITCH
R 2 3  1           # R
L 3 0  0.001       # L
